        "answer": {
          "short": "$69$",
          "worked": "Subtract the selection containing only even numbers from all selections.\n$$\\begin{aligned}N&={}^{8}C_{4}-{}^{4}C_{4}\\\\&=70-1\\\\&=69\\end{aligned}$$",
